 ## ✨ Features Implemented in the Base Foundation
 .
 - **100% Native Rust Desktop GUI (`eframe` / `egui` + `glow` OpenGL):** Zero
 WebView overhead, instant startup, low memory footprint, and dark-mode SQL
 workbench layout.
 - **Connection Manager & Built-in Sandbox Mode:**
   - Connect to any MySQL 8.0+ or MariaDB server with SSL/TLS (`Preferred`,
 `Required`, `Disabled`) and native SSH port forwarding (`ssh -N -L`).
   - Includes an instant **⚡ Sandbox Demo (`ecommerce_prod`)** connection
 profile preloaded with `users`, `products`, `orders`, `order_items`, and
 `payments` so you can test every feature immediately without a local MySQL
 server.
 - **Schema Explorer & ER Overview:**
   - Live introspection of databases, tables, approximate row counts, columns,
 primary keys (`🔑`), foreign keys (`🔗`), and indexes via
 `INFORMATION_SCHEMA`.
   - Quick actions (`SELECT *`, `DDL`, `Insert Name`) and an Entity-Relationship
 (ER) schema diagram tab.
   - **Favorite / Pinned Tables (`★` / `☆`):** Pin frequently used tables to
 the top of the Schema Explorer per connection profile.
 - **Multi-Tab SQL Editor with 2-Tier Autocomplete:**
   - Custom SQL lexer and syntax highlighter (keywords, functions, types,
 strings, numbers, comments).
   - **Tier 1 (<1 ms):** Local schema-aware suggestions for tables,
 `alias.column` completions, Foreign Key `JOIN ... ON` clauses, and SQL
 keywords.
   - **Tier 2 (AI Ghost Text):** 3 selectable engines in AI Settings:
     - ⚡ **Option 1: Local Schema Native (0ms, 100% Offline):** Instant
 schema-driven SQL predictions for `SELECT`, `JOIN`, `WHERE`, `ORDER BY`,
 `INSERT`, `UPDATE` with zero latency.
     - 🦙 **Option 2: Ollama FIM (~100ms):** Ultra-fast local
 Fill-In-The-Middle inference using `qwen2.5-coder:1.5b`.
     - 🤖 **Option 3: GitHub Copilot:** Native Device Code OAuth flow to
 connect your official GitHub Copilot subscription.
   - **Quick SQL Macros (`Tab`):** Expand short abbreviations (`sel*`, `selw`,
 `cnt*`, `join*`, `ins*`, `upd*`, `del*`, `grp*`) directly in the editor.
   - **Parameterized Queries (`:param_name`):** Automatic dynamic parameter bar
 with safe value substitution before execution.
   - **Persistent Scratchpad Tabs:** Auto-saves open query tabs every 5 seconds
 and restores them on startup.
   - **Global Command Palette (`Ctrl+K` / `Ctrl+P`):** Instant fuzzy search
 across tables, saved snippets, and workbench actions.
   - **Professional SQL Formatter (`Ctrl+Shift+F`):** Built-in beautifier
 (`sqlformat`) that cleans clauses, indentations, and standardizes keyword
 casing.
   - **Visual Transaction Controls:** Manual transaction mode with `[Begin Tx]`,
 `[Commit]`, `[Rollback]` buttons, and uncommitted mutation tracking.
 - **Interactive Results Grid & 1-Click Data Visualization:**
   - Virtualized multi-column table with column sorting, client-side pagination
 (25, 50, 100, 250, 500, All), and execution metrics.
   - **Multi-Results Sub-Tabs:** Executing multi-statement SQL scripts renders
 each result set in its own sub-tab (`Result 1`, `Result 2`, ...).
   - **Developer Copy Formats:** Right-click any column header to copy values as
 `SQL IN (...)` or `JS/TS Array`.
   - **FK "Browse Related Rows":** Right-click any cell with an outgoing or
 incoming foreign key relationship to jump directly to the related rows in a new
 tab.
   - **No-Code Visual Filter Bar:** Instant multi-operator column filtering
 (`contains`, `=`, `!=`, `starts with`, `>`, `<`, `IS NULL`, `IS NOT NULL`).
   - **Cell Value & JSON Inspector (`🔍`):** Modal inspector with
 pretty-printed JSON detection, character/byte counters, and copy-to-clipboard.
   - **Inline Cell Editing:** Double-click any cell on a single-table query with
 a Primary Key to edit values inline and commit parameterized `UPDATE`
 statements.
   - **1-Click Interactive Charts (`egui_plot`):** Switch instantly between
 `📋 Table` and `📊 Chart` (Bar and Line charts) with configurable X/Y axis
 dropdowns.
   - **AI Insights:** One-click `🤖 AI Insights` button to analyze query
 results and extract key trends, statistics, and anomalies.
   - **One-Click Exports & CSV Import Wizard:** Export results to **CSV**,
 **JSON**, **Markdown Table**, or **SQL `INSERT`** statements, or import CSV
 files with column mapping into existing or new tables.
 - **Production Guard & Safe Mode (Security):**
   - **Environment Badging:** Tag connections as `Dev` (green), `Staging`
 (yellow), or `Production` (red).
   - **Read-Only Mode:** Lock any profile to block all mutation queries
 (`INSERT`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE`, `DROP`, `ALTER`, `TRUNCATE`).
   - **Destructive Query Confirmation Modal:** Intercepts unconstrained `UPDATE`
 / `DELETE` (without `WHERE`), `DROP`, or `TRUNCATE` before execution.
 - **Visual EXPLAIN Plan Tree & Index Advisor:**
   - Color-coded graphical breakdown of execution steps (`ALL` in red, `range`
 in yellow, `ref/const` in green).
   - **Smart Index Advisor:** Automatically detects full table scans (`ALL`) and
 filesort bottlenecks, generating recommended `CREATE INDEX` statements with
 1-click Copy and Open in Tab.
 - **Schema Diff & Synchronization:**
   - Visual comparison between any two databases (e.g. `dev` vs `prod`).
   - Generates executable `ALTER TABLE` and `CREATE TABLE` migration DDL scripts
 as well as structured Up/Down versioned migration files.
 - **Table Designer with Up/Down Migration Generator:**
   - Visual table creation and alteration with one-click generation of
 reversible migration scripts (`-- >>> UP MIGRATION` / `-- <<< DOWN MIGRATION`).
 - **Server Administration & Real-Time Metrics:**
   - Live charts for Queries/sec (QPS) and Active Connections (Threads).
   - Live `SHOW FULL PROCESSLIST` with instant `🛑 Kill Query` action.
   - **Server Variables Inspector:** Filterable real-time browser for `SHOW
 VARIABLES` with fast search and copy.
 - **Snippets & Query Bookmarks:**
   - Save, organize, and load frequent queries with one click; filter history
 and snippets instantly.
 - **Dockable AI SQL Copilot & CLI Assistant:**
   - Automatically injects compact DDL (`TABLE ...`, `FK ...`) of the active
 database into prompts.
   - Supports **Ollama**, **OpenAI-Compatible APIs**, **Anthropic Claude**,
 **Google Gemini**, and **Local CLI commands** (`agy`, `llm`, etc.).
   - One-click **`🔧 Fix Query with AI`** button whenever a SQL query returns
 an error.
