 ## 📦 Download Pre-built Binaries
 .
 Every push to `main` automatically builds and publishes ready-to-run installers
 on the [**Latest Release
 (`latest`)**](https://github.com/juancastingo/mysql-rusty/releases/tag/latest):
 .
 | Platform | Package | Install / Run |
 | :--- | :--- | :--- |
 | **Linux (Ubuntu / Debian)** | `.deb` / `.tar.gz` | `sudo apt install
 ./mysql-rusty_*.deb` |
 | **Windows (x86_64)** | `.exe` / `.zip` | Download and run
 `mysql-rusty-windows-x86_64.exe` |
 | **macOS (Apple Silicon)** | `.dmg` | Open `mysql-rusty-macos-arm64.dmg` and
 drag `MySQL-Rusty.app` to Applications |
 .
 ### Install via APT Repository (Ubuntu / Debian)
 Once the APT repository is published on GitHub Pages, you can install and
 receive updates directly with `apt`:
 .
 ```bash
 curl -fsSL https://juancastingo.github.io/mysql-rusty/KEY.gpg | sudo gpg
 --dearmor -o /usr/share/keyrings/mysql-rusty.gpg
 echo "deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/mysql-rusty.gpg]
 https://juancastingo.github.io/mysql-rusty stable main" | sudo tee
 /etc/apt/sources.list.d/mysql-rusty.list
 sudo apt update
 sudo apt install mysql-rusty
 ```
